{"seq":2,"slug":"realtime-scheduling","title":"实时与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/systems/realtime-scheduling","wordCount":1438,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"实时与调度\">实时与调度</h1><p>实时系统的「正确」有两个维度：算出对的结果，且在对的时间算出来。飞控律晚算 50 毫秒，再正确的输出也可能让飞机失稳。这意味着安全攸关软件必须能在设计阶段就证明「每个任务都能在截止期前完成」，而不是上线后祈祷。Ada 把实时调度理论直接编进语言与运行时——固定优先级、天花板协议、绝对延迟——再配合最坏情况执行时间（WCET）分析与可调度性分析，让时序正确性成为可论证的工程属性。这一章讲清 Ada 的实时调度机制与背后的数学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Ada 实时模型建立在「固定优先级抢占式调度」之上：每个任务有一个静态优先级，调度器总是运行就绪任务中优先级最高的，高优先级任务可抢占低优先级任务。围绕这个内核，Ada 提供了消除优先级反转的协议、精确的时间基准，以及支持周期性任务的延迟原语。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[实时任务集] --&gt; B[分配静态优先级&lt;br/&gt;速率单调 RMS]&#10;  B --&gt; C[固定优先级抢占调度]&#10;  C --&gt; D[天花板优先级协议&lt;br/&gt;消除优先级反转]&#10;  D --&gt; E[WCET 分析&lt;br/&gt;每任务最坏执行时间]&#10;  E --&gt; F[可调度性分析&lt;br/&gt;利用率/响应时间]&#10;  F --&gt; G{所有截止期满足?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[时序正确性已论证]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[重新分配优先级/周期]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[实时任务集] --&gt; B[分配静态优先级&lt;br/&gt;速率单调 RMS]\n  B --&gt; C[固定优先级抢占调度]\n  C --&gt; D[天花板优先级协议&lt;br/&gt;消除优先级反转]\n  D --&gt; E[WCET 分析&lt;br/&gt;每任务最坏执行时间]\n  E --&gt; F[可调度性分析&lt;br/&gt;利用率/响应时间]\n  F --&gt; G{所有截止期满足?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[时序正确性已论证]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[重新分配优先级/周期]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><p>下表列出常用实时调度策略及其在 Ada 中的体现。Ada 默认并主要支持固定优先级，因为它最可分析、最易认证。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调度策略</th>\n<th>优先级分配</th>\n<th>可分析性</th>\n<th>Ada 支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>速率单调 RMS</td>\n<td>周期越短优先级越高</td>\n<td>强（有界利用率判据）</td>\n<td>固定优先级 pragma</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截止期单调 DMS</td>\n<td>截止期越短优先级越高</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>固定优先级 pragma</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最早截止期优先 EDF</td>\n<td>动态按截止期</td>\n<td>理论最优但难认证</td>\n<td>Ada 2012 起部分支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮转分时</td>\n<td>同优先级时间片</td>\n<td>弱（不适合硬实时）</td>\n<td>Round_Robin 策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"固定优先级与抢占\">固定优先级与抢占</h2><p>Ada 用 <code>pragma Priority</code> 给任务赋予静态优先级，用 <code>pragma Locking_Policy</code> 与 <code>pragma Task_Dispatching_Policy</code> 选择调度与加锁策略。安全攸关系统几乎总是选 <code>FIFO_Within_Priorities</code>——同优先级先来先服务，跨优先级严格抢占：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ada\" data-code=\"pragma Task_Dispatching_Policy (FIFO_Within_Priorities);&#10;pragma Locking_Policy (Ceiling_Locking);&#10;&#10;task Flight_Control with Priority =&gt; 20;   -- 高频高优先级&#10;task Telemetry     with Priority =&gt; 5;     -- 低频低优先级\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pragma Task_Dispatching_Policy (FIFO_Within_Priorities);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pragma Locking_Policy (Ceiling_Locking);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>task Flight_Control with Priority => 20;   -- 高频高优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>task Telemetry     with Priority => 5;     -- 低频低优先级</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Flight_Control</code> 一旦就绪就能立即抢占正在运行的 <code>Telemetry</code>，保证关键控制律不被次要任务拖延。这套确定性调度正是 <a href=\"../safety/ravenscar-concurrency\">Ravenscar 并发模型</a> 限制任务结构的目的——只有结构受限，调度才可被静态分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"速率单调分析与可调度性\">速率单调分析与可调度性</h2><p>如何决定优先级？速率单调调度（RMS）给出一条简洁规则：周期越短的任务优先级越高。在此基础上，Liu 与 Layland 的经典定理给出一个充分判据：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立周期任务的 CPU 总利用率满足下式时，它们必定可调度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{C_i}{T_i} \\leq n \\left( 2^{1/n} - 1 \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的最坏执行时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其周期。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时，这个上界收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.693</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln 2 \\approx 0.693</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.693</span></span></span></span></span>，即只要总利用率不超过约 69%，固定优先级调度就保证所有截止期都能满足。更精确（但需迭代求解）的是响应时间分析，它对每个任务计算最坏响应时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 并验证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i \\leq T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这些分析让「能否按时完成」成为上线前就能回答的数学问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"天花板协议消除优先级反转\">天花板协议消除优先级反转</h2><p>优先级反转是实时系统的著名陷阱——1997 年火星探路者就因它反复重启。场景是：低优先级任务持有一把锁，中优先级任务抢占了它，导致需要那把锁的高优先级任务被间接阻塞。Ada 的受保护对象内建<strong>天花板优先级协议</strong>（在上面的 <code>Ceiling_Locking</code> 下生效）来根除它：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ada\" data-code=\"protected Shared_Data&#10;   with Priority =&gt; 21   -- 天花板 = 所有可能访问者的最高优先级&#10;is&#10;   procedure Update (X : Integer);&#10;end Shared_Data;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>protected Shared_Data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   with Priority => 21   -- 天花板 = 所有可能访问者的最高优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>is</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   procedure Update (X : Integer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end Shared_Data;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当任务进入受保护对象时，其优先级被临时提升到该对象的天花板（高于任何可能访问它的任务）。于是没有中优先级任务能在它持锁期间抢占它，反转被从机制上杜绝，且最坏阻塞时间有界、可纳入响应时间分析。这是语言级机制胜过手工加锁的又一例证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wcet-分析的输入与难点\">WCET：分析的输入与难点</h2><p>所有可调度性分析都依赖一个输入：每个任务的最坏情况执行时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。求得可信的 WCET 是实时工程最难的环节之一——现代处理器的缓存、流水线、分支预测让执行时间高度依赖运行历史。实践中通常结合静态分析工具（沿控制流求路径上界）与基于测量的方法，并对硬件特性做保守假设。AdaCore 生态中常与 Rapita 等 WCET 与时序覆盖工具配合，这类工具也是 <a href=\"../practice/certification-do178c\">安全认证与 DO-178C</a> 取证材料的一部分。Ravenscar 之所以禁掉动态特性，正是为了让 WCET 与调度分析在数学上可行——可预测的代码结构是可预测时序的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实时正确性是双维度的：结果对 + 时间对；安全攸关系统必须在设计阶段证明所有任务都能在截止期前完成。</li>\n<li>Ada 默认采用固定优先级抢占式调度（<code>FIFO_Within_Priorities</code>），因其最可分析、最易认证。</li>\n<li>速率单调调度按「周期越短优先级越高」分配，Liu-Layland 判据给出总利用率上界（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n\\to\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时约 69%），响应时间分析给出更精确的逐任务保证。</li>\n<li>受保护对象的天花板优先级协议从机制上根除优先级反转，使最坏阻塞时间有界、可纳入分析。</li>\n<li>所有分析都以 WCET 为输入，求可信 WCET 是最难环节；Ravenscar 禁动态特性正是为了让 WCET 与调度分析在数学上可行。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实时与调度","id":"实时与调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"固定优先级与抢占","id":"固定优先级与抢占"},{"level":2,"text":"速率单调分析与可调度性","id":"速率单调分析与可调度性"},{"level":2,"text":"天花板协议消除优先级反转","id":"天花板协议消除优先级反转"},{"level":2,"text":"WCET：分析的输入与难点","id":"wcet-分析的输入与难点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"底层表示与硬件访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/systems/low-level-representation"},"next":{"title":"无 GC 的内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/systems/memory-without-gc"}}